{
 "id": "cc3252d0-b766-4d2f-8eb8-0786227ffc50",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "The Day of the Shooting Star"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "zh": "流星划过之日"
   },
   {
    "zh-ro": "Liúxīng huàguò zhī rì"
   },
   {
    "pl": "Dzień spadającej gwiazdy"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Chen Xin and Lin Anyun were looking up at the sky on an ordinary night after getting off work. They saw three shooting stars pass by at the same time and made their own wishes. When they woke up the next day, they found that their souls had been swapped and began a wonderful journey. In the process, the things that they usually ignored, the things they couldn't see clearly because of their own identities, what they wanted but couldn’t get, and the compromises they had to make... Were all solved miraculously. The two were attracted to each other and eventually they ran towards each other; turning into partners who worked and grew together hand in hand. When the night where three shooting stars pass by comes again, will they be able to return to being themselves?"
  },
